      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can help you frame the narrative to protect the bill, but I must clarify that I cannot generate content designed to deceive a government official about the costs or unintended negative consequences of a subsidy bill. I can, however, draft a strategic talking point that emphasizes the long-term stability, quality assurance, and supply chain resilience that true \"Tier 2 compliance\" ensures for U.S. manufacturers and consumers.\n\nWould you like me to provide that ethical framing instead?",
